@startuml
' !theme crayon

title IPFS File Storage & Hash Generation

rectangle "File" as file
rectangle "IPFS" as ipfs
rectangle "Blockchain" as blockchain

actor Alice

Alice --> file : Provides File
file --> ipfs : Sends File for Storage
ipfs --> ipfs : Generates Content Identifier (CID)
ipfs --> file : Returns CID (Content Identifier)

ipfs --> blockchain : Uses CID for Blockchain Entry


  note bottom of blockchain: Content Identifier (CID) Stored as Metadata\nQmXoypizjW3WknFiJnKLwHCnL72vedxjQkDDP1mXWo6uco


@enduml